<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-24753] Calcite. TPC-H query #16: too long for scale=0.1 and 1.0</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-24753</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Works for scale factor 0.01 but doesn&apos;t complete in 5 minutes for scale factors 0.1 and 1.0.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;***&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Load test (1 client node, 3 server nodes) shows that there is an unproportional increase of HEAP memory usage for scales 0.1 and 1.0 comparing to 0.01.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For scale=0.01 it were executed about 700 queries in 5 seconds.&#160; With average 2.99Mb and 5.68Mb of heap allocation per request (on client and server correspondingly).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For scales 0.1 and 1.0 single query was calcelled after 5 minutes, having&#160; Gigabytes of allocated per the single query.&lt;/p&gt;

